><span begin="00:29.000" end="00:29.330">so </span><span begin="00:29.330" end="00:29.450">much </span><span begin="00:29.450" end="00:30.410">stronger</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.410" end="00:31.520"><span begin="00:30.410" end="00:31.040">Than </span><span begin="00:31.040" end="00:31.160">I </span><span begin="00:31.160" end="00:31.520">thought</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.520" end="00:32.420"><span begin="00:31.520" end="00:31.700">Your </span><span begin="00:31.700" end="00:31.970">eyes </span><span begin="00:31.970" end="00:32.090">are </span><span begin="00:32.090" end="00:32.420">wide</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.420" end="00:33.560"><span begin="00:32.420" end="00:32.705">And </span><span begin="00:32.705" end="00:32.990">though </span><span begin="00:32.990" end="00:33.275">your </span><span begin="00:33.275" end="00:33.560">soul</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.590" end="00:34.940"><span begin="00:33.590" end="00:33.770">it </span><span begin="00:33.770" end="00:34.400">can't </span><span begin="00:34.400" end="00:34.610">be </span><span begin="00:34.610" end="00:34.940">bought</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.940" end="00:36.530"><span begin="00:34.940" end="00:35.090">your </span><span begin="00:35.090" end="00:35.390">mind </span><span begin="00:35.390" end="00:35.540">can </span><span begin="00:35.540" end="00:36.530">wander</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.680" end="00:39.110"><span begin="00:36.680" end="00:37.610">Hello</span><span begin="00:37.610" end="00:37.640">, </span><span begin="00:37.640" end="00:39.110">Hello</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.140" end="00:40.130"><span begin="00:39.140" end="00:39.281">Hola</span><span begin="00:39.281" end="00:39.422">! </span><span begin="00:39.422" end="00:39.563">[</span><span begin="00:39.563" end="00:39.704">Spanish </span><span begin="00:39.704" end="00:39.845">for </span><span begin="00:39.845" end="00:39.986">Hello</span><span be